  "question": {
    "text": "The parabolas : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;intersect on the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi></math> are positive real numbers and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>, then"
  },
  "options": [
